Package: wbkernel
Type: Package
Title: Single-Pass EABYEP Soil-Water-Balance Kernel
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Atlas", "Pipeline", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "p.steward@cgiar.org")
Description: Rcpp single-pass daily soil-water-balance kernel (wb_kernel_cpp) for
    the NDWS / NDWL0 / NDWL50 hazard indices. Marches days per cell carrying soil
    availability, returning per-cell-day ERATIO (-> NDWS) and LOGGING (-> NDWL)
    plus the final availability (next-month seed). Replaces the R per-day terra
    loop in fast_calc_NDWS/NDWL0/NDWL50.R. Packaged so parallel (future) workers
    load it via library() (no sourceCpp-into-shared-env), same as trendkernel.
